  "question": {
    "text": "Let the vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;represent three coterminous edges of a parallelopiped of volume <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>. Then the volume of the parallelopiped, whose coterminous edges are represented by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
