  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know that,</p><p>Volume of parallelepiped whose edges determined by vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Now it is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>&nbsp;is volume of parallelepiped&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;so&nbsp;required volume of parallelepiped with new edges will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
